\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The ECR-Cover planning--execution--observation loop. Planning produces timed viewpoint queues from a frozen feasible map and end-to-end time bounds. Physical coverage is updated only after command acknowledgment, stable pose, dwell, a fresh usable frame, and pose--frame synchronization. Availability events invoke residual-task repair, but the original queues remain the executable comparison baseline.}}{5}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
